{
  "story_id": "pilgrim-shell",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 378072,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The second day was harder than the first.",
      "start_ms": 1964,
      "end_ms": 4715
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Sofia's legs were sore.",
      "start_ms": 4715,
      "end_ms": 6286
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Marisa was tired from the beginning.",
      "start_ms": 6286,
      "end_ms": 8709
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "They walked more slowly.",
      "start_ms": 8709,
      "end_ms": 10346
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "They stopped more often.",
      "start_ms": 10346,
      "end_ms": 11983
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But the path was beautiful.",
      "start_ms": 11983,
      "end_ms": 13816
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "It went through oak woods and cornfields and past ruined stone monasteries.",
      "start_ms": 13816,
      "end_ms": 18793
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "They passed cows and chickens and a pair of small brown horses.",
      "start_ms": 18793,
      "end_ms": 22983
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "They met other pilgrims.",
      "start_ms": 22983,
      "end_ms": 24620
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Some overtook them.",
      "start_ms": 24620,
      "end_ms": 25930
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Some they overtook.",
      "start_ms": 25930,
      "end_ms": 27240
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "There was a small language between pilgrims — you said Buen Camino when you passed someone.",
      "start_ms": 27240,
      "end_ms": 33264
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "That was the whole conversation, most of the time.",
      "start_ms": 33264,
      "end_ms": 36603
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "It was enough.",
      "start_ms": 36603,
      "end_ms": 37651
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "\"Aunt Marisa,\" Sofia asked, at one point, \"why are you doing this.",
      "start_ms": 37651,
      "end_ms": 42038
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Really.",
      "start_ms": 42038,
      "end_ms": 42562
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Not just the — I want to be with you thing.",
      "start_ms": 42562,
      "end_ms": 45443
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Why the walk.\" Marisa thought as she walked.",
      "start_ms": 45443,
      "end_ms": 48390
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "She said, \"When I was your age, my grandmother — my father's mother, whom you never met — walked the Camino.",
      "start_ms": 48390,
      "end_ms": 55527
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "She was already old.",
      "start_ms": 55527,
      "end_ms": 56902
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "She had wanted to do it her whole life.",
      "start_ms": 56902,
      "end_ms": 59521
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "She got sick shortly after.",
      "start_ms": 59521,
      "end_ms": 61355
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Not the same kind of sick as me — hers was her heart.",
      "start_ms": 61355,
      "end_ms": 64890
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "She died two years later.",
      "start_ms": 64890,
      "end_ms": 66593
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "But she had walked the Camino.",
      "start_ms": 66593,
      "end_ms": 68623
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "She told me, before she died, that she was glad she had done it.",
      "start_ms": 68623,
      "end_ms": 72879
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "She said walking a hundred kilometers had — done something to her.",
      "start_ms": 72879,
      "end_ms": 77266
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "I am not sure exactly what.",
      "start_ms": 77266,
      "end_ms": 79100
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "She could not describe it.",
      "start_ms": 79100,
      "end_ms": 80868
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "She just said — do it, before you cannot.",
      "start_ms": 80868,
      "end_ms": 83618
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I have thought about it my whole life.",
      "start_ms": 83618,
      "end_ms": 86171
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Then I got sick.",
      "start_ms": 86171,
      "end_ms": 87285
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "And I thought — if I do not do it now, I might not ever do it.",
      "start_ms": 87285,
      "end_ms": 91410
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "So I am doing it.\"",
      "start_ms": 91410,
      "end_ms": 92719
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "\"Are you scared, Aunt Marisa,\" said Sofia.",
      "start_ms": 92719,
      "end_ms": 95535
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "\"About being sick.\" Marisa was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 95535,
      "end_ms": 98874
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Then she said, in a level voice, \"Yes.",
      "start_ms": 98874,
      "end_ms": 101428
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "I am scared.",
      "start_ms": 101428,
      "end_ms": 102279
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I do not know how the treatment will go.",
      "start_ms": 102279,
      "end_ms": 104964
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I do not know if I will live to be old.",
      "start_ms": 104964,
      "end_ms": 107583
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Some days I am very scared.",
      "start_ms": 107583,
      "end_ms": 109417
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Some days I am less scared.",
      "start_ms": 109417,
      "end_ms": 111250
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Today I am walking a path in the beautiful Galician countryside with my niece, and today I am not scared.",
      "start_ms": 111250,
      "end_ms": 118191
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Today I am — grateful.",
      "start_ms": 118191,
      "end_ms": 119697
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "That is another feeling I have a lot, alongside the scared.",
      "start_ms": 119697,
      "end_ms": 123626
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Both are true.\"",
      "start_ms": 123626,
      "end_ms": 124608
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Sofia thought about this.",
      "start_ms": 124608,
      "end_ms": 126319
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "She said, \"I am also scared, Aunt Marisa.",
      "start_ms": 126319,
      "end_ms": 129084
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Sometimes.",
      "start_ms": 129084,
      "end_ms": 129808
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "That you might not — that this might be the last time we get to do something like this together.\" Marisa stopped walking.",
      "start_ms": 129808,
      "end_ms": 137838
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "She looked at Sofia.",
      "start_ms": 137838,
      "end_ms": 139220
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "She said, \"Sofia.",
      "start_ms": 139220,
      "end_ms": 140405
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I have not thought about it exactly that way.",
      "start_ms": 140405,
      "end_ms": 143433
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "But — you are right that we do not know.",
      "start_ms": 143433,
      "end_ms": 146131
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "That is why we are doing this.",
      "start_ms": 146131,
      "end_ms": 148172
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Not because it is the last time.",
      "start_ms": 148172,
      "end_ms": 150344
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "But because we do not know.",
      "start_ms": 150344,
      "end_ms": 152187
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "That is why anyone does anything with someone they love.",
      "start_ms": 152187,
      "end_ms": 155939
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Because you do not know.",
      "start_ms": 155939,
      "end_ms": 157584
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "That is not a sad thing.",
      "start_ms": 157584,
      "end_ms": 159230
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That is just the truth of it.",
      "start_ms": 159230,
      "end_ms": 161204
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Come.",
      "start_ms": 161204,
      "end_ms": 161599
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Let us walk.",
      "start_ms": 161599,
      "end_ms": 162455
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Buen Camino.\" And they walked on.",
      "start_ms": 162455,
      "end_ms": 164759
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "On the third day they stopped for a long rest at a small ancient stone fountain by the side of the path.",
      "start_ms": 164759,
      "end_ms": 171670
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Water came out of a stone spout worn smooth by hundreds of years of pilgrim hands cupping it.",
      "start_ms": 171670,
      "end_ms": 177857
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "There were three other pilgrims there when they arrived — an old couple from Spain and a young Australian man.",
      "start_ms": 177857,
      "end_ms": 185163
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Everyone drank.",
      "start_ms": 185163,
      "end_ms": 186216
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Everyone rested.",
      "start_ms": 186216,
      "end_ms": 187335
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "The old Spanish woman looked at Marisa, and something in her face changed.",
      "start_ms": 187335,
      "end_ms": 192272
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "She came over.",
      "start_ms": 192272,
      "end_ms": 193259
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "She said, in Spanish, \"Are you well, sister.\" Marisa said, \"I am on the walk.",
      "start_ms": 193259,
      "end_ms": 198393
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I am doing all right.\" The old woman looked at her for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 198393,
      "end_ms": 202672
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "She said, \"I walked this thirty years ago with my sister.",
      "start_ms": 202672,
      "end_ms": 206489
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "She was younger than me.",
      "start_ms": 206489,
      "end_ms": 208135
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "She was sick like you, I think.",
      "start_ms": 208135,
      "end_ms": 210241
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "She died four years later.",
      "start_ms": 210241,
      "end_ms": 212018
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "But she walked.",
      "start_ms": 212018,
      "end_ms": 213071
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "She walked all one hundred kilometers.\"",
      "start_ms": 213071,
      "end_ms": 215770
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Marisa did not answer for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 215770,
      "end_ms": 218140
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "She said, softly, \"Thank you for telling me.\" The old woman said, \"I want to give you something.",
      "start_ms": 218140,
      "end_ms": 224524
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Wait.\" She reached into her pocket.",
      "start_ms": 224524,
      "end_ms": 226894
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "She took out a small smooth stone.",
      "start_ms": 226894,
      "end_ms": 229197
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "It was warm from her pocket.",
      "start_ms": 229197,
      "end_ms": 231106
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "It was a small piece of quartz, worn smooth.",
      "start_ms": 231106,
      "end_ms": 234068
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "She said, \"My sister carried this on her walk.",
      "start_ms": 234068,
      "end_ms": 237162
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She left it at Santiago at the end.",
      "start_ms": 237162,
      "end_ms": 239531
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I went back years later and I picked it up.",
      "start_ms": 239531,
      "end_ms": 242427
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "I have carried it since.",
      "start_ms": 242427,
      "end_ms": 244073
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "But it is time.",
      "start_ms": 244073,
      "end_ms": 245126
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I want you to have it.",
      "start_ms": 245126,
      "end_ms": 246640
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Carry it.",
      "start_ms": 246640,
      "end_ms": 247298
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Leave it wherever you like.",
      "start_ms": 247298,
      "end_ms": 249141
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "At Santiago, or before.",
      "start_ms": 249141,
      "end_ms": 250721
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "It is your stone now.\" And she pressed it into Marisa's hand.",
      "start_ms": 250721,
      "end_ms": 254736
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Marisa held the small stone in her hand for the rest of that afternoon.",
      "start_ms": 254736,
      "end_ms": 259716
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "She did not put it in her pocket.",
      "start_ms": 259716,
      "end_ms": 262068
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "She just held it.",
      "start_ms": 262068,
      "end_ms": 263313
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Sofia walked beside her.",
      "start_ms": 263313,
      "end_ms": 265043
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Neither of them spoke for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 265043,
      "end_ms": 267741
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "After maybe an hour, Marisa said, \"That is a very beautiful thing.",
      "start_ms": 267741,
      "end_ms": 272375
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "That an old stranger gave me her sister's stone.",
      "start_ms": 272375,
      "end_ms": 275765
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I do not know what to do with it.",
      "start_ms": 275765,
      "end_ms": 278117
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "But I feel — very taken care of.",
      "start_ms": 278117,
      "end_ms": 280399
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "By people I do not even know.",
      "start_ms": 280399,
      "end_ms": 282474
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "That is a strange feeling.\" Sofia said, \"That is what people do on the Camino.",
      "start_ms": 282474,
      "end_ms": 287939
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "That is what happens.\"",
      "start_ms": 287939,
      "end_ms": 289599
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" said Marisa.",
      "start_ms": 289599,
      "end_ms": 290983
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "\"That is what happens.",
      "start_ms": 290983,
      "end_ms": 292574
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "It is not just a walk, Sofia.",
      "start_ms": 292574,
      "end_ms": 294649
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I did not fully understand this until now.",
      "start_ms": 294649,
      "end_ms": 297623
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "It is — people looking after each other on a walk.",
      "start_ms": 297623,
      "end_ms": 301151
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "It has been that for a thousand years.",
      "start_ms": 301151,
      "end_ms": 303849
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "And now we are part of it too.",
      "start_ms": 303849,
      "end_ms": 305993
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "That is what my grandmother could not describe.",
      "start_ms": 305993,
      "end_ms": 309314
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "She just knew.\"",
      "start_ms": 309314,
      "end_ms": 310490
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "That night the pilgrims cooked supper together at the albergue kitchen.",
      "start_ms": 310490,
      "end_ms": 315470
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Marisa and Sofia had bought bread and cheese and a few tomatoes at a small village shop.",
      "start_ms": 315470,
      "end_ms": 321627
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Other pilgrims had bought other things.",
      "start_ms": 321627,
      "end_ms": 324394
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "A tall Dutchman had brought a chicken.",
      "start_ms": 324394,
      "end_ms": 327091
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "A woman from Colombia had brought rice.",
      "start_ms": 327091,
      "end_ms": 329858
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Somehow everyone's food became one meal.",
      "start_ms": 329858,
      "end_ms": 332694
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Everyone sat down together at a long wooden table.",
      "start_ms": 332694,
      "end_ms": 336222
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Everyone told small stories about the day.",
      "start_ms": 336222,
      "end_ms": 339197
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "There was a lot of laughter.",
      "start_ms": 339197,
      "end_ms": 341203
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "It was, Sofia thought, one of the best meals of her life.",
      "start_ms": 341203,
      "end_ms": 345215
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "She had never eaten with strangers before.",
      "start_ms": 345215,
      "end_ms": 348189
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "She had never known you could feel so much like family with people you would not see again after tomorrow.",
      "start_ms": 348189,
      "end_ms": 355660
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "That night she lay in her bunk beside Marisa's and she thought about the walk.",
      "start_ms": 355660,
      "end_ms": 361125
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "About the stone.",
      "start_ms": 361125,
      "end_ms": 362300
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "About the people at the fountain.",
      "start_ms": 362300,
      "end_ms": 364652
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "About the meal.",
      "start_ms": 364652,
      "end_ms": 365759
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "She said, quietly, \"Aunt Marisa.",
      "start_ms": 365759,
      "end_ms": 368042
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Are you awake.\" Marisa said, \"Yes.\" Sofia said, \"I am glad I came.\" Marisa was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 368042,
      "end_ms": 374890
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Then she said, \"So am I, sweetheart.",
      "start_ms": 374890,
      "end_ms": 377449
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "So am I.\"",
      "start_ms": 377449,
      "end_ms": 378072
    }
  ]
}